# Read by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify (ignored by Live Server). See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
# Pages and scripts are revalidated on every visit, so a new version is never mixed with an old cached
# module (that mix breaks the site: "module does not provide an export named …").
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=()

/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/*.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/*.css
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/manifest.webmanifest
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/sounds/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
